-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Nested Loop Left Join
   Output: "*VALUES*".column1, (count(*))
   ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
         Output: "*VALUES*".column1
   ->  Custom Scan (TessAgg)
         Output: (count(*))
         ->  Custom Scan (TessPack)
